  "notes": "{稼|かせ}ぐ is a godan verb meaning to earn money or gain something through effort.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Takes を particle: Xを{稼|かせ}ぐ (to earn X)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{稼|かせ}いでいる indicates ongoing earning: ⟦アルバイト→アルバイト：01528_arubaito⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{稼|かせ}いでいる (I'm earning through part-time work).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦お{金|かね}→お金：00611_okane⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{稼|かせ}ぐ: to earn money\n- ⟦{生活費|せいかつひ}→生活費：19424_seikatsuhi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{稼|かせ}ぐ: to earn a living\n- ⟦{時間|じかん}→時間：00468_jikan⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{稼|かせ}ぐ: to buy time (idiomatic)\n- ⟦{点|てん}→点：01553_ten⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{稼|かせ}ぐ: to score points\n- ⟦{外貨|がいか}→外貨：12152_gaika⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{稼|かせ}ぐ: to earn foreign currency\n\nCONTRAST:\n- {稼|かせ}ぐ emphasizes active earning through work\n- ⟦{儲|もう}ける→儲ける：20583_moukeru⟧ emphasizes profit, making money (business)\n- ⟦{得|え}る→得る：02014_eru⟧ is more general 'to obtain'\n\nRELATED:\n- ⟦{稼|かせ}ぎ→稼ぎ：27765_kasegi⟧: earnings, income (noun)\n- ⟦{稼働|かどう}→稼働：16938_kadou⟧: operation (machines working)",
